**VERDICT RULES.** GO needs steps 1-3 and 5-7 measured with controls, c0 and c1 green, c-fail met, your hand rows green at head and red under their mutants, H8 byte-equal, the whole-suite runs of step 4 with zero red at head that are not red at main, the failed-read and never-answers rows done and graded, the local CI line green, every NOT RUN named. GO WITH FINDINGS = Minor/Note only (say "NO PR; hosted CI and CodeQL NOT RUN" on the line above the verdict line). NO GO on any Blocker or Major, with the class named, "round 1 of 2", and the fix-shape in prose (a second NO GO on this class closes it and goes to the product owner). **First line of STATUS (placeholder at Step 0 `GATE VERDICT B1070: PENDING`; verdict form, ONE line):** `GATE VERDICT B1070: branch b1063/mps-317-add-section-waits-for-price-list <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> @ 35996bc on main 3496da3 (round 1 of 2 on class "web: Add section waits for the price list", NO GO 0 before; NO PR, hosted CI and CodeQL NOT RUN - delta <1 commit, 5 paths, +<a> -<r>; HOLDS bytes n; test lines removed n; edited row +1 -0 y/n; added literals or JSX text n; readiness words blob = main y/n> - fix <six clicks pending adds n of three ways; default after answer y/n; click-after y/n; answer-between y/n; no-grant offered y/n; no-rights offered y/n; both buttons y/n; request bytes equal y/n; persona switch y/n; StrictMode y/n; clause 1 MET|NOT MET; clause 2 MET|NOT MET> - failed read <released y/n; section default y/n; rebate field y/n; box shown y/n> - never answers <disabled y/n; sections added n; words added n; existing note shown y/n; client timeout y/n; grade> - mutants <c0, c1; GW n of 12; survivors n; GW5 unreachable y/n; MW11 rate n of 30 by band; injected latency n/20 at d; attribution to load SUPPORTED|NOT SUPPORTED|NOT MEASURABLE; c-fail y/n> - suite <head runs n red n; main runs n red n; other racy n; edited row alone n of N; names lost n added n> - Node <local v26.8.1, CI 24, hosted job judges> - CI local <lint, test,